sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(React)
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant TR as Google Translate
    participant ENC as SigLIP2 Encoder
    participant MV as Milvus
    participant RR as BGE Reranker

    U->>FE: Enter query (Vietnamese paragraph)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/search<br/>{queries: [...], config: {rerank: true}}

    Note over BE: Split paragraph into N sentences

    loop For each sentence
        BE->>TR: Translate VI → EN
        TR-->>BE: English sentence
        BE->>ENC: encode_text(sentence)
        ENC-->>BE: 768-dim vector
    end

    alt N = 1 (single sentence)
        BE->>MV: search_single(vector, top_k=200)
    else N > 1 (multi-sentence)
        BE->>MV: search_hybrid(N vectors, RRF k=60)
    end

    MV-->>BE: Top 200 candidates

    Note over BE: Tier 2 — Cross-Encoder Reranking

    loop For each candidate
        Note over RR: score(query, objects + OCR text)
    end
    BE->>RR: rerank(query, candidates, top_k)
    RR-->>BE: Top K sorted by rerank_score

    Note over BE: Build results + neighbor frames

    BE-->>FE: SearchResponse<br/>{results, translations, search_time_ms}
    FE-->>U: Display ranked keyframes
